#X text 20 10 PULSE NETWORK — heartbeat \, divisions \, logic \, chance \, sound;
#X text 20 30 toggle [run] \, then turn DSP on (Cmd+/);
#X text 20 50 watch the LEDs first — five voices follow the same triggers;
#X text 90 415 ÷2 thump;
#X text 190 415 ÷3 blip;
#X text 290 415 ÷4 kick (Bernoulli);
#X text 390 415 ÷8 hat;
#X text 490 415 AND ping;
#X text 660 60 ← master tempo (lower = faster);
#X text 660 110 ← chance a ÷4 kick passes;
#X text 660 200 ─── voices ─────────────────;
#X text 660 220 ÷2 → low thump (osc 70 \, 200ms);
#X text 660 240 ÷3 → mid blip (osc 320 \, 90ms);
#X text 660 260 ÷4 (gated) → noise kick (50ms);
#X text 660 280 ÷8 → hi-hat (HP noise \, 30ms);
#X text 660 300 AND → sine ping (osc 440 \, 250ms);
